00:07:56.130 --> 00:07:57.630
the term for when electronics

00:07:57.630 --> 00:07:59.880
reach the end of their life cycle.

00:07:59.880 --> 00:08:02.190
The episode covers their
environmental impact

00:08:02.190 --> 00:08:05.100
and explores things
consumers can do about it.

